    "Id": "chassisdef_morpheus_MRP-3S",
    "Name": "Morpheus",
    "Details": "Considering its size and armor protection, the Morpheus is somewhat underarmed for its role. The Morpheus's main weapons are its Claw and Spikes which are backed up by three ER medium lasers and a single Magshot. The heavy armor allows the Morpheus to close with an opponent and inflict damage via the melee weapons.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Protected Actuators</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.09</color></b>",
