  "StockRole": "Gladiator",
  "YangsThoughts": "A Solaris VII BattleMech, the Morpheus is a heavily-armored combatant. The high ground speed allow the Morpheus to close quickly, while the heavy armor protects the 'Mech and pilot from enemy fire. The Morpheus is basically a larger version of the Tsunami medium arena fighter, and the engineers of Omnitech Industries learned many lessons from the Tsunami's disappointing appearance. Strangely, one thing they didn't bring over to the Morpheus was triple strength myomer.",
